tag\" >Ludicrous weapon variety</h2><br>80 unique weapons that can drop as loot and can contain a funky mix of over 30 enchantment types.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.poster.avif?t=1773756876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.webm?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.mp4?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO much more</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Music and audio by the great <strong>Andrew Hulshult</strong>.<br></li><li>Non-intrusive but mysterious story.<br></li><li>Many game modes.<br></li><li>A mix of manual and random level generation.<br></li><li>Tons of random events and secrets.</li></ul><br><i>You rise to prevent her doom<br>and duke it out with nightmares<br>to reap salvation in blood.</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fd442cf64d7e0bf1ff6fa714bdd4423f196bac19.jpg","localized_name":"Offender","name":"Offender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1051690/fd442cf64d7e0bf1ff6fa714bdd4423f196bac19.jpg"},{"icon":"fb9d8f68bd6d57219cc30b3c4e447c853f930f38.jpg","localized_name":"Repeat offender","name":"Repeat offender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1051690/fb9d8f68bd6d57219cc30b3c4e447c853f930f38.jpg"},{"icon":"59e75a19ec7cd639d2a31de52e30a6437dc67318.jpg","localized_name":"Killer","name":"Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1051690/59e75a19ec7cd639d2a31de52e30a6437dc67318.jpg"},{"icon":"398bcc8952ffb4d60a796a2ff5aaed60b320e54c.jpg","localized_nam